+//! Two-node libp2p swarm: TCP (+ optional QUIC listen) + Noise/Yamux + Kad put/get
+//! of signed `PeerRecord`. Separates libp2p PeerId from Raven Ed25519 identity.
+//! No FastAPI / HTTP API in path.
+
